 Assessment."}]}], "template_override": 1}], "id": 0, "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "id": 0, "contents": [{}]}, {"id": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn5le03ob11re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn5le03ob11re2img05.jpg", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn5le03ob11re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Hey Vanessa! Moved out and on your own now, eh? I'm excited to see your new place!  <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I'll take you on a tour of it! We'll start in the living room!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Wow, it looks bigger than I thought, not as small as I thought it'd be.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: You won't believe all the apartment listings I looked through. Will you come and visit me soon?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: It looks like I've got to, your place looks awesome! I love that couch!<br>", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn5le03ob11re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: There's lots of space! It's more spacious than the apartment I looked at a few blocks down.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Show me more.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Let me show you my bedroom and the ensuite. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: An ensuite? That's sweet! <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Yes and guess what I got!<br>", "id": 2, "time": "24000", "image": "engenn5le03ob11re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: What?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: My own washer and dryer! <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: That's incredible! Will you buy more furniture? <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I'll buy a better refrigerator. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Will you cook more now?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I won't be doing that.<br>", "id": 3, "time": "37500", "image": "engenn5le03ob11re2img02.jpg"}]}}]}]}], "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Vanessa's Stories"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "A Brand New Place to Live"}, {"type": "position", "content": 11}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 3}, {"type": "level", "content": "A2.2"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Describe rooms, homes and objects in buildings in common social and work situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Describing a New Home"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "When you compare two things, you use a <span class=\"strong\">comparative</span>. You can use <span class=\"italic\">than</span> or  <span class=\"italic\">as \u2026 as. </span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">We can show that two things are equal by using <span class=\"strong\">as + adjective + as</span></span> "}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">There</span> is no difference between the two compared objects or ideas."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">We can show that two things are not equal by using</span> <span class=\"strong\">not + as + adjective + as</span> "}, {"type": "text", "content": "When comparing with than, the adjective you use can change  depending on the number of syllables it has: <ul><li>1-syllable adjectives: add -er to the adjective<br><span class=\"italic\"> nice \u2192 nicer</span> </li><li> 2-syllable adjectives ending in -y: change the -y to -ier <br><span class=\"italic\">busy \u2192 busier </span> </li><li>Adjectives with 3 or more syllables: use more with the unchanged adjective<br> <span class=\"italic\">expensive \u2192 more expensive</span> "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Certain adjectives have irregular forms in the comparative. For example: <br> <span class=\"italic\">good \u2192 better<br>bad \u2192 worse</span> "}, {"type": "example", "content": "This couch is nicer than that couch."}, {"type": "example", "content": "This street is busier than my old street."}, {"type": "example", "content": "My condo was more expensive than the other apartment."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Talking about Actions and Events"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "When you use the Future tense, you use the auxiliary <span class=\"italic\">will</span>. "}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Form\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Structure\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Example\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Affirmative \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"will + base form of the verb (long form)  \u2018ll + base form of the verb (short form)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I will show you around my apartment. <br>I'll come visit you in the fall. </span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Negative\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"will not + base form of the verb (long form) won't + base form of the verb (short form)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">You will not believe it!<br>I won't come in the winter.</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Interrogative \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Will or Won't + subject + base form of the verb. (yes-no question) Wh-word + will or won't + subject + base form of the verb (wh-question)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Will you buy some furniture?<br>Won't you cook dinner?</span> \\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to move out"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to go live in a different place"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I want to move out when I'm done school."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le03ob11aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are the words to review. "}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "living room"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the main room in a house where people relax"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The living room has a large television. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le03ob11aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "apartment listing"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a small advertisement for an apartment "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example:  You won't find any apartment listings there."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le03ob11aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "spacious"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "having a large amount of space"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Look at this spacious living room."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le03ob11aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "bedroom"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a room for sleeping in"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: It's a one-bedroom condo."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le03ob11aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "ensuite"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a bathroom that is joined to a bedroom"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The apartment unit includes an ensuite."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le03ob11aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "washer and dryer"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a washing machine and a clothes dryer"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example:  I have to buy a washer and dryer."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le03ob11aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "furniture"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "large objects you use in a home"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The apartment includes furniture."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le03ob11aud08"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "refrigerator"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a large piece of kitchen equipment you use to  keep food cool"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The kitchen includes a refrigerator. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le03ob11aud09"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn5le03ob11re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Look through magazines. Go on the internet."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Find pictures of different rooms you like."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Find pictures of objects in rooms you like."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Choose two different rooms. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Compare them. Use comparatives."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write 4-5 sentences that describe each room."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read your sentences aloud to your class."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I talk about rooms and objects in them."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I use comparatives when talking about rooms."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I read my sentences aloud."}]}], "type": "sena"}